    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You weave chakra straight into the senses of your target. A Genjutsu Specialist's victims feel things that never happened: a faceless friend dying, a sword that never struck them, a maze that wasn't there. You break minds the way a Taijutsu Specialist breaks ribs.</p>\n<p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 6 + Constitution</p>\n<p><strong>Key Attribute</strong> Charisma</p>\n<p><strong>Initial Proficiencies</strong> trained in simple weapons and unarmed attacks; trained in light armor and unarmored defense; trained Perception and Fortitude, expert Will; trained in Occultism plus 4 additional skills</p>\n<p><strong>Spellcasting</strong> full chakra caster; spell DCs and attack rolls use Charisma; tradition is chakra. Your jutsu prefer the <em>genjutsu</em>, <em>mental</em>, <em>emotion</em>, and <em>illusion</em> traits.</p>\n<p>At 1st level you gain the shared chakra-core features plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtGenjutsuSpc0]{Genjutsu Specialization} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtGenjutsuPth0]{Genjutsu School}.</p>"
    },
